  "description": "High-performance CSV and XLSX exporting library for .NET 9/10.\n            Built on CsvHelper and SpreadCheetah for maximum performance and stability.\n            Convention-based, customizable via ExportRule<T>, supports async streaming,\n            multi-sheet XLSX, auto-zip, column formatting, and minimal API integration.\n            Version 5 is a complete redesign of v4 with breaking changes and no PDF support.",
